{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-6", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "舊日詩篇", "storyInfo": "失去摯友的恨意在贊索斯心中湧動，無處排遣。老人揭露了一段塵封的往事，讓贊索斯發現了帕夏派遣使節團前來交換文物的真正目的。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wilderness_y", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_blackmask", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_oldtv", "layer": 2.0}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$minos_folk_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你真的決定要離開村子嗎？", "name": "憂心的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明天天一亮就動身。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "田地都已經重新耕過一遍，種子和存糧足夠，倉庫也都修過了，擺渡的技術，我也教給了那幾個年輕人，別擔心。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$2"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是擔心你啊，贊索斯。", "name": "憂心的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你從來沒離開過這片沼地，現在跑那麼遠的路，就為了找一個外鄉人？", "name": "憂心的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊薩科斯是我的兄弟，他也幫助過我們所有人。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一年過去了，或許他已經回雅賽努斯了……畢竟，那才是他的故鄉。", "name": "憂心的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他答應過的事，都會做到。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他答應過我，打完了仗，便會回來。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你有沒有想過，如果……如果他已經……", "name": "憂心的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他去的地方，是和薩爾貢人的戰場啊……", "name": "憂心的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我就替他報仇，替米諾斯人報仇。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wild_m", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>米諾斯，北部山地</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_only_heavy", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 1.0}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1", "posfrom": "150,0", "posto": "150,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你別激動！你認錯人了！我真的不是什麼伊薩科斯！", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "激動的是你，同胞。我只是認出了你身上的這塊護甲。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "150,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這塊護甲屬於伊薩科斯，我的弟弟。臨行前，村裡每家每戶都送來了獸皮和鐵器，我親手為他縫製了勉強像樣的全身甲冑，打造了武器。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱、抱歉，一直在打仗，大大小小的仗，我已經很久沒睡過好覺了，精神有點……", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "給你，壺裡還有一些寧神的草茶。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkswllw", "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkswllw", "channel": "2", "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請告訴我，你從誰那裡得到這塊護甲的？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "另一個游擊隊的戰友。我們在一場遭遇戰中相遇……他中了箭，嚥氣前，給了我……", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但他不叫伊薩科斯。", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看這護甲上面的痕跡，斑駁成這樣，明顯已經經手過很多人……", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你或許不瞭解，游擊隊比不上薩爾貢人的正規軍，我們的物資非常有限。", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大家往往會將武器、防具和糧食集中起來，再按照任務的優先順序統一調配。", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我可以告訴你那個戰友所在游擊隊的編號，以及他們現在所在的方位……啊，我得先把這塊護甲還給你。", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "留著吧，你還用得著。同胞，告訴我在哪個方向就好。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可以是可以，但你真要進山找嗎？", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一整片山地都是游擊隊活躍的地方，是我們和薩爾貢人的戰場……", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我申請加入游擊隊。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你上過戰場嗎？", "name": "游擊隊員A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2084_1#1$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（搖頭）在這之前，我的手只握過船槳和農具。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我們別無選擇，不是嗎？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wild_a", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-40,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，你說的那個愛笑的長髮豐蹄，我沒有太多印象。", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於這雙靴子，是我剛加入游擊隊時領到的……按照當時送物資過來的戰友的說法，這雙靴子屬於一個左邊角缺了一塊的中年大叔。", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "靴子破了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對、對不起。這雙靴子對我來說有點小，我還來不及補。", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那幫薩爾貢人一直緊追在我們後面，要不是你及時趕到支援……", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "坐下來。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我幫你補。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.2}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_putontable_large"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_tapemeasure"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wild_a", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-40,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝你……啊，你的手雖然大，但是好靈巧啊……你加入游擊隊多久了？", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "四個多月……起初是為了找人。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這雙靴子，你留著吧。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "戰鬥、轉移、蟄伏、整頓。流血，死去或者擦乾再投入下一場戰鬥……這樣的日子，還有很長。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "游擊隊員B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2083_1#1$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1", "posfrom": "200,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 1.0, "focus": "r,m"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "送來這雙靴子的戰友來自哪裡？同胞，告訴我在哪個方向就好。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_outcounty", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我就說這面盾角落的符號肯定有什麼含義……原來是“伊薩科斯”名字的縮寫，你刻的？", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（點頭）", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，這大半年，你一直輾轉在各個戰場，幾乎在每一個游擊隊都待過，就是為了找人？", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來，你也沒辦法告訴我更多。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，贊索斯。而且，我不打算把這面盾還給你。", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看看，這上面的刀痕有多少！還有這些黑印……薩爾貢人的法術都沒轟碎這面盾牌！", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我得留著這個，這樣才能保護更多戰友，或者讓我活到能回家的那天。", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那樣的話，就再好不過了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就讓“伊薩科斯”的名字與你同在，就讓我們的血與眼，見證我們的勝利。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#9$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就在此分別吧，我的戰友。", "name": "游擊隊員C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2071_1#1$2"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "同胞，告訴我在哪個方向就好。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_cave_2", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以試著換個方向。伊薩科斯是左撇子，所以當時陪他打造這個施術單元的時候，我刻意設計過。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難怪，我就說怎麼功率不對勁！", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……贊索斯，這麼說起來，已經一年多了啊。", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真快啊，時間就像化凍後的河流。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你已經成為這片山地裡最有名的游擊隊員，你打過最多的仗，去過最多的戰場，大家無不讚嘆你的英勇……", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你的弟弟，你真的還要一直找下去嗎？", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我沒有停下來的理由。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就像，你也不會轉身離開這片戰場。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，說得也是。", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽你的口音，你來自拉刻代蒙？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "算是吧，真要說的話，我的家鄉在那座移動城市的航道旁邊，是個河谷，春天的時候很漂亮。", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我剛剛跟你講過了我的家鄉，我和伊薩科斯共同建起來的那座小村子，你也跟我說一下你的家鄉吧。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們已經輸了一百多年了，都不確定這場戰爭的結局如何，我們應該銘記彼此的家鄉……我們應該銘記彼此。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#9$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "樂意之至，我的同胞。", "name": "游擊隊員D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明天，我將繼續啟程尋找。同胞，告訴我在哪個方向就好。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_forest", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_164"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_164", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米諾斯人，為什麼要將我綁在樹上羞辱？", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我說過，回答我的問題。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_164", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊薩科斯伊薩科斯，又是伊薩科斯！", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "*薩爾貢粗口*，好了，我受不了了……兩年前，在這附近，我帶領的隊伍確實遭遇過一支護送傷員的米諾斯游擊隊。", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我記得他們的旗幟，和你剛剛說的編號對得上。", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們全滅了那支游擊隊。你說的那個什麼伊薩科斯，應該就在那群人裡。", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你滿意了嗎？你們專門布置了這場伏擊，就是為了兩年前的那場戰鬥，就是為了抓我這一個人報仇？", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "瘋子，米諾斯人，你真是個瘋子！", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說來你或許不相信，這只是一個巧合。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天之前，我並沒有想過會找到伊薩科斯，或者殺害了他的敵人。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這場戰鬥，和這一年多來，不，和這一百多年來發生的每一場戰鬥，並沒有什麼不同。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢人，你們侵占了別人的土地，而我們，不得不保衛自己的家園。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是習慣了逢人便問：“請問你見過伊薩科斯嗎？你見過那個愛笑的長髮豐蹄嗎？他從雅賽努斯來，但有一些南方鄉下的口音。”", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這麼看來，我真的是你所說的，“瘋子”。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_164", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我找到了他的護甲、他的靴子、他的盾、他的施術單元……我找到了他留在這片山林裡的一切。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我找到了他。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我當然不期待你這樣的賊寇能記清楚每個米諾斯人的名字，你們的帕夏也並不在意功勞冊上的每一筆實際上對應著什麼，對吧？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼……“伊薩科斯”，你就記住這一個名字。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這個名字是我們的情與愛，也是你們的罪與罰。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_164", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "贊索斯", "content": "現在，告訴我——"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.4, "xstrength": 60.0, "ystrength": 60.0, "vibrato": 70.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "贊索斯", "content": "那場戰鬥到底發生在什麼位置？！"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 70.0, "ystrength": 70.0, "vibrato": 80.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "贊索斯", "content": "那些米諾斯人，他們的血到底流進了哪一棵樅樹下？！"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_164", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "薩爾貢軍官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_164"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_breezetree", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$distressed_intro", "key": "$distressed_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.4, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "贊索斯抬眼望去，成百上千棵米諾斯樅樹傲然挺立著身軀。風吹來，整片樹林撲簌作響。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "這片土地，這些林木，它們記得很多事，但它們不會言說。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "他的弟弟，他的摯友，循著神諭離開家鄉的年輕人，死在其中的某一處——每一處。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "伊薩科斯，無數的伊薩科斯，為了保護腳下的這片土地，屍骨無存。", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "贊索斯抬起了手中的巨槳——一年多了，它已經遺忘了河流的聲響，能夠濕潤它的，唯有仇人的血！", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——！", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_twohandedblunt", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 25.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "58_g14_yanprison", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你替伊薩科斯報了仇？", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2"}, {"id": 338, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在我抬起手中的武器即將砸向那個薩爾貢人頭顱的瞬間，同胞制止了我的動作，與此同時，號角響了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您從來沒告訴過我，您經歷的那場戰役就是……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "贊索斯", "content": "那是米諾斯和薩爾貢簽署正式停戰協議前的最後一場仗，輸了百年的米諾斯——"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "贊索斯", "content": "呵，終於贏了。"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位同胞死命按著我的手，他的腿斷了一條，拖住我的力氣還是很大。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我轉過頭，發現他滿臉是淚，眼神中全是恐懼……不是對薩爾貢人的，而是對我的恐懼。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$2"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道他在害怕什麼。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#5$2"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他怕我毀了來之不易的“和平”；他怕我引發新的衝突，讓殘酷的戰爭持續；他怕自己跟伊薩科斯一樣，再也回不了家。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我所有積壓的怒火和悲痛無處發洩，只能死死盯著那個跪在地上的薩爾貢軍官，而他正發楞地聽著號角聲，表情跟我一樣麻木……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那一刻我就知道，戰爭會在我們的體內延續，它只會開始，從不結束。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$2"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老先生您說得對，我心中的米諾斯早就不在了，它在好幾年前就隨著那些“伊薩科斯”死在了戰場上。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我不能容許敵人再次踐踏這片土地，哪怕這裡是他們建造的城市。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2"}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“他們建造的城市”……連我們的教科書上，也是這麼寫的？", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼意思？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2"}, {"id": 369, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊薩科斯去過你的村莊，憑那小子熱情得不像是我兒子的天性，他一定教了你們很多建築技術。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 372, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，他幾乎改建了村中每一處重要設施。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他的手藝傳自祖輩，在侵占時期，我的爺爺還曾因為工程技術太好，被薩爾貢人強征去建移動城市。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這座雅賽努斯城的動力層，或許就有他的手筆吧。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 386, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，剛剛我對您太失禮了，我……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 390, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小子，別因為這點事就對人低頭。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我又不是建造移動城市的工程師，況且沒有任何東西能證明我們祖先曾為雅賽努斯的建設受過苦，所有的資料當時都被薩爾貢人收走了。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 394, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢人要米諾斯工程師的工作資料……為什麼？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 398, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "工程師的手記，除了記錄專業用語和圖紙的修改方案之外，總會有些其他東西。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他當時需要核對建材的數量，統籌搬運和建築小組，所以他很清楚人力排布，也記得每個工人的名字——", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 402, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是薩爾貢的工人，而是米諾斯勞工的名字，還有他們從哪裡來，又是怎麼被薩爾貢人強徵來的資訊。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 403, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "呂刻伊昂", "content": "米諾斯工人？我記得現在主流的觀點是，在三城建設時期瑪拉帕夏沒有徵用任何一名米諾斯工人進行粗重工作——"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "呂刻伊昂", "content": "難道……"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "歷史不是由我們書寫的，哪怕我們打贏了最後一場仗。", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 412, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但那些都是罪證，應該把這些罪證都公之於眾，老先生您還記得那些工程師手記在哪裡嗎？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1"}, {"id": 416, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這我怎麼知道，你得問薩爾貢人……哦，不過當時的薩爾貢人現在應該也都死光了，哈哈……", "name": "伊薩科斯父親"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 419, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 421, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "問薩爾貢人……三城建設時期……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2"}, {"id": 423, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 70.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不對！", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2"}, {"id": 428, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼了，老師？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 430, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 431, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢使節想要用文物從我們這裡換走的根本不是技術資料，而是那些記載了薩爾貢人罪證的工程師手記！", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2"}, {"id": 432, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 433, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 434, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 435, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 436, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 437, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 438, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}